WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:05,940
What's wrong with you

2
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:10,940
Can you help me?

3
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:25,840
You tell the truth every day like this

4
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,340
Since it was discovered that the liquid in the Golden River can enhance energy

5
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:30,340
We all started eating it alive

6
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,840
Yi Neng has gone up a bit

7
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:34,300
But the body is completely broken

8
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,800
More than 800 people

9
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,300
More than 150 energy benefiters

10
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,300
Fireworks are set off on the fire and thunder can explode at any time

11
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,800
At first it was just a headache, like there were ants crawling around

12
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:41,800
Later it was nerve pain

13
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,800
Like someone playing guitar with your veins, playing faster and faster

14
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,800
Instead, I want to destroy everything that is noisy and moving.

15
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:46,800
tell them all to be quiet
